{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今私、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメAKB0048にハマってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/6065012/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメ普段まったく見ないけどこれは好きー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週録画して楽しくみてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/6065012/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"声優選抜の方々もみんな上手ですごいな(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵の感じとか色合いがかわいくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々ワイルドな戦闘シーン（セレクションシーン!）もあったりして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/6065012/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このアニメはマクロスの監督さんやスタッフさんが作成してるんですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/26/6065012/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マクロスは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ライオン」や「星間飛行」が好きでよく鼻歌うたってますd(゜ー゜*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれめっちゃ詳しい！？って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違うんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニメファンの姉からの受け売りです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マクロス見たことヾ（・ω・）ナイです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アニソンは自分では聴かないのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragra